"weighted_vote_score": "0.696439027786254883", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 31, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "216813169", "author": {"steamid": "76561199205217241", "personaname": "Linfried", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199205217241/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 315, "playtime_forever": 121, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 121, "last_played": 1683946739, "avatar": "0aea48366278d5f57db3417ba1301593310e8998"}, "language": "english", "review": "Low content,\t0.00%\r\nSlow pace,\t0.00%\r\nTotal,\t0% (F)\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1769384024, "timestamp_updated": 1769384024, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.362181961536407471", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216727412", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992074420", "personaname": "smithbt5", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992074420/", "num_games_owned": 339, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1442, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1440, "last_played": 1769299369, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Maybe not what was expected, and certainly buggy in places.   It's still a fun ride as a single player game.", "timestamp_created": 1769297170, "timestamp_updated": 1769297170, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.429283350706100464", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216181678", "author": {"steamid": "76561198385796689", "personaname": "Galaxy💙", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GalaxySparan/", "num_games_owned": 909, "num_reviews": 94, "playtime_forever": 239, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 51, "last_played": 1770192716, "avatar": "6fd6306940aca09da69db68b0480068d4979d2de"}, "language": "english", "review": "This feels like a ubisoft game but somehow worse\n2.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1768672221, "timestamp_updated": 1768672719, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 7, "weighted_vote_score": "0.539210855960845947", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "hardware": {"system_ram": "63081", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 16302}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "216100989", "author": {"steamid": "76561198231449156", "personaname": "PluckinBallSack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198231449156/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2303, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 637, "deck_playtime_at_review": 12, "last_played": 1774991471, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game does fall rather short compared to other Arkane titles but if you realise this and can grab the game at a hefty discount then I'd say to give it a shot (just limit your expectations).\n\nI'm playing Solo and to be honest it's the perfect game to throw on if you want to enjoy the classic Arkane art style & scenery without having to think too much. \n\nRedfall is a nicely thought out location, no copy-paste rubbish and there are sections that can become a little tricky if youre not too careful.\n\nAs others have described, its a little bit like Far Cry with vamps and id go one further to say its got a hefty Left for Dead vibe as well. It's honestly not as bad as others make out especially after the patches.\n\n\nYes it couldve been soo much more but if you want to have a wonder around an environment that to me is a blend of Twin Peaks & Alan Wake, id say dive in.", "timestamp_created": 1768589301, "timestamp_updated": 1768671655, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.564950168132781982", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215496457", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971925488", "personaname": "Grandpa Who", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/korahan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 3497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3497, "last_played": 1716073266, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I understand all the negative reviews; they are mostly based on disappointment.\n\nBut in hindsight, if you play with a friend and don’t expect a multiplayer Dishonored, this game is worth $10–15 on sale.\n\nAlso, it is an American game. As you should know by now, most American gaming companies have become greedy beyond imagination.\nIf you want a great game without monetization nonsense and with long-term support (Baldur’s Gate 3 – Belgium, Clair Obscur – France, Enshrouded – Germany), or a great redemption story (No Man’s Sky – Great Britain, Cyberpunk – Poland), you have to buy European. From American studios, you can mostly expect mediocre or bad AAA games with little to no long-term support for single-player titles.\n\nEven within Arkane, the better games came from France, while Austin brought us… well, this.\n\nSo check where the game you’re interested in was made and manage your expectations accordingly.", "timestamp_created": 1767893250, "timestamp_updated": 1767893250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 15, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.588161826133728027", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "214879650", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962019866", "personaname": "Thulsa Doom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197962019866/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 1052, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1052, "last_played": 1767321590, "avatar": "86e972c36e219bd7df245f68e9d04f1ea76e89d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Oh boy. This game was not very good but some might enjoy running around and collecting items while fighting/avoiding vampires. Feels like this game went through dev hell.\r\n\r\nArt style isn't for me. I'd describe the character models as ugly fortnite characters. Sometimes it feels kind of creep[y going through dark houses while a vampire taunts you. Then you see him and expect him to break out in a fortnite dance. Not sure what they were going for with this style.\r\n\r\nThe story is boring. Mostly told through reading notes and seeing some audio/visual logs while exploring. Before missions you get some visual novel cheap scene. Yeah not much effort was made.\r\n\r\nEnemy AI is not very smart but you might have a decent time exploring and doing stuff around the map.", "timestamp_created": 1767321925, "timestamp_updated": 1767321925, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}]}